<OLI>A list of at least three installations meeting requirements set forth in paragraph OPERATING EXPERIENCE.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Owner and location of each installation.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Date of owner acceptance of each installation.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Collector model number.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Design inlet gas volume,<MET> L/s</MET><ENG> acfm</ENG>.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Design inlet gas temperature, degrees<MET> C</MET><ENG> F</ENG>.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Design inlet dust loading,<MET> grams per liter</MET><ENG> grains per acf</ENG>.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Design outlet dust loading<MET> grams per liter</MET><ENG> grains per acf</ENG>.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Type of [coal-fired] [oil-fired] [boiler] [refuse-fired waste disposal incinerator].</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL><SUB>Certification of Testing Capability</SUB></TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Certify that the factory is capable of performing electrical integrity tests of 1000 volts for hopper heater modules, blanket or tape.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL><SUB>Voltage Testing Certificate</SUB></TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
